The pure-Python ML-KEM-768 implementation follows FIPS 203; its correctness is
cross-checked against Go's crypto/mlkem in the test suite.

The wildcard hostname checker bundles the Public Suffix List from
https://publicsuffix.org/ (Mozilla Public License 2.0).  The original license
header is retained in utls/_public_suffix_list.dat.
